# Python bytecode from running scripts/generate_company_metadata.py or its
# tests. The cache filename is interpreter-pinned (e.g. `.cpython-314.pyc`), so
# committing it means every contributor on a different Python emits a different
# file and any generator run produces a spurious binary diff — in the one repo
# where a clean, reviewable diff matters most.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
